  "insights": [
   "AI performance is increasingly limited by the 'memory wall,' where compute FLOPS have scaled 3x every two years while DRAM bandwidth has only improved 1.6x, creating a 600:1 performance gap.",
   "HBM (High-Bandwidth Memory) is the primary solution to this bottleneck, with HBM4 expected to double bus capacity to 2,048 bits and exceed 2 TB/s per stack in 2026.",
